---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Editorial Policy | Vyxqor" description="How Vyxqor reviews and scores AI tools. Independent, transparent, and methodology-driven.">
<div class="container" style="padding: 48px 0 80px; max-width: 720px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Editorial Policy</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px;">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-2);">
    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Vyxqor exists to help people make better AI tool decisions. Every review, comparison, and ranking is produced with editorial independence. Commercial relationships do not determine our editorial output.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">How We Test</h2>
      <p>Every tool we review is tested hands-on by our team. We:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>Use the tool for real-world tasks relevant to its category</li>
        <li>Test across multiple platforms (web, desktop, mobile where applicable)</li>
        <li>Verify pricing and features against official documentation</li>
        <li>Document limitations and bugs honestly</li>
        <li>Re-test after major updates</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Vyxqor Score Methodology</h2>
      <p>Our 0–100 score is calculated across six dimensions:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li><strong>Capability (25%):</strong> What can the tool actually do? How well?</li>
        <li><strong>Ease of Use (15%):</strong> How intuitive is the interface? Learning curve?</li>
        <li><strong>Value (15%):</strong> Price vs. feature set. Free plan quality.</li>
        <li><strong>Reliability (15%):</strong> Uptime, speed, consistency of output.</li>
        <li><strong>Features (15%):</strong> Depth and breadth of functionality.</li>
        <li><strong>Integrations (15%):</strong> Third-party connections, API quality, platform support.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Scores are not influenced by affiliate commissions or commercial partnerships.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Ranking Rules</h2>
      <p>Rankings (e.g., "Best AI Writing Tools") are ordered by:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>Vyxqor Score</li>
        <li>Use case fit for the specific ranking topic</li>
        <li>User feedback and market adoption</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Paid placement is never used to determine editorial rankings. Sponsored or featured listings are clearly labeled separately.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Correction Policy</h2>
      <p>If we discover an error in our content, we correct it promptly and note the correction date at the bottom of the affected page. If you spot an error, contact: <a href="mailto:editorial@vyxqor.com" style="color: var(--accent);">editorial@vyxqor.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>